    """Return the applied closure that must survive a rollback, or None if invalid.

    G2 keep-set: every `retain` ID plus, transitively, the applied dependencies it
    needs. Removing a dependency while keeping its dependent would leave a state
    that could never have been reached by a rollout, so retention follows the same
    edges as the graph (dependent -> dependency) rather than only the direct list.
